<title>UK: Telkom at $33.45 in London at 1013 GMT.</title>
<headline>Telkom at $33.45 in London at 1013 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Telkom traded at $33.45 and London at 1013 GMT on Monday. It recorded the day's low of $33.435 and the day's high of $33.495.</p>
<p>Its previous close on Friday $32.50. One ADS represents 20 ordinary shares -- Jakarta newsroom (Tel: 6221-3846364).</p>
